       SHORTER than before. (The old min(380px, 100%) card width that
       lived here is no longer needed: cards are 100% at every size.) */
    .photo-strip-photo {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    /* Arrows on phones (2026-08-20, PM request): bigger tap targets and
       pulled in tight to the photo's edges. Vertically centered on the
       PHOTO (33%), not the card — the card's height includes the caption
       underneath, so centering on it would sit them visibly low. */
    .photo-strip-arrow {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      /* No `top` here any more — the base rule centres the arrows on
         the photos at every width. */
    }

    .photo-strip-arrow-prev {
      left: 10px;
    }

    .photo-strip-arrow-next {
      right: 10px;
    }
  }
 
  /* ---- HOME PAGE SPACING (2026-09-23, PM-approved mockup
     "MOCKUP-4-home-spacing", option B, "the most spacious") ----
     Every band on the home page had 48px above and below, but inside
     the hero the banner sat only 32px under the headline and the
     carousel 40px under the banner, so the page read as tight and
     uneven. One value now rules all of it: --home-pad is the gap
     between the headline and the banner, the banner and the carousel,
     the carousel and "What's next", and the top/bottom padding of every
     other band. 96px on desktop, 64px on phones (same 2:3 ratio the
